# ============================================================================
# TECH_DOCX  —  Documentation generator  ·  Git ignore
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# We keep generator scripts (.py) and the input PDFs in git, but NOT
# regenerated artefacts (regen any time with `python build_*.py`) and NOT
# Word's lock/temp files.
# ============================================================================

# Python build artefacts
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.venv/
venv/

# Word lock files (when a .docx is open in Word, it creates ~$file.docx)
~$*.docx
~$*.xlsx
~$*.pptx

# Backup conversions
*.bak
*.tmp

# If you want regenerated docs OUT of git, uncomment the next line.
# phase4SEALED.docx
